    "notes": "F-012 is an ownership-only remediation. The physical surround remains exactly 1 metre. standSetup and scene3d now consume SCENE_SURROUND_M from one canonical source. scene3d's behavior/state/placement/performance domains are declared affected because the source-file governance map requires those domains whenever scene3d changes; no module behavior, editable-state schema, placement algorithm, performance policy, catalog, persistence, BOM, or asset semantics are intentionally changed. Full-system discovery surfaces above were reviewed because scene3d and the change-gate ownership map are broad dependency roots; listing them does not imply runtime edits to those files. The existing browser smoke flow creates a real stage and protects runtime module loading after the shared import change."
